<title>UK: Dorling Kindersley appoints adult div head.</title>
<headline>Dorling Kindersley appoints adult div head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British book publishers Dorling Kindersley Holdings Plc said it had appointed Nicholas Barnard as managing director of its Adult division.</p>
<p>The Adult division publishes over 100 information and reference titles every year.</p>
<p>Barnard was previously editorial director at Haynes Publishing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
